### MallaLab · ejemplos de API
### Requiere la extension "REST Client" de VS Code (humao.rest-client)

@host = http://localhost:8080

### Listar carreras
GET {{host}}/api/careers

### Malla completa de TI
GET {{host}}/api/careers/TI-ESPE/curriculum

### Minimo teorico y cuellos de botella
GET {{host}}/api/careers/TI-ESPE/insights

### Escenario base: alumno que aprobo hasta cuarto semestre
### resultado: baselineTerms=4, totalTerms=4, delay=0, totalCredits=60
POST {{host}}/api/planner/simulate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "careerCode": "TI-ESPE",
  "approved": [
    "EXCT-A0301", "EXCT-A0302", "COMP-A0J01", "EXCT-A0201", "TCON-A0304", "CHUM-A0100",
    "EXCT-A0303", "EXCT-A0001", "EXCT-A0401", "COMP-A0J07", "ELEE-A0442",
    "EXCT-A0402", "COMP-A0G02", "EXCT-A0501", "COMP-A0I02", "COMP-A0J09", "COMP-A0F02",
    "COMP-A0I03", "COMP-A0G05", "COMP-A0G03", "ELEE-A0344", "SEGD-A0000", "COMP-A0H02"
  ],
  "failed": [],
  "maxCreditsPerTerm": 18
}

### Que pasa si pierdo Estructura de Datos
### resultado: baselineTerms=5, totalTerms=6, delay=1, totalCredits=77
POST {{host}}/api/planner/simulate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "careerCode": "TI-ESPE",
  "approved": [
    "EXCT-A0301", "EXCT-A0302", "COMP-A0J01", "EXCT-A0201", "TCON-A0304", "CHUM-A0100",
    "EXCT-A0303", "EXCT-A0001", "EXCT-A0401", "COMP-A0J07", "ELEE-A0442",
    "EXCT-A0402", "COMP-A0G02", "EXCT-A0501", "COMP-A0I02", "COMP-A0F02"
  ],
  "failed": ["COMP-A0J09"],
  "maxCreditsPerTerm": 18
}

### Guardar el escenario en el historial
POST {{host}}/api/planner/simulate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "careerCode": "TI-ESPE",
  "approved": ["COMP-A0J01", "COMP-A0J07"],
  "failed": ["COMP-A0J09"],
  "save": true
}

### Historial
GET {{host}}/api/planner/runs?career=TI-ESPE
